          },
          {
            "pin": "MOSI",
            "function": "MOSI"
          },
          {
            "pin": "CS",
            "function": "CS"
          }
        ]
      },
      "notes": "Insert card facing the module pads correctly. SD cards need formatting (FAT32). Use CS-to-3.3V pull-up."
    },
